  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Spotlight Initiative Africa Regional Programme (SIARP) 2.0 represents a strategic collaboration between the African Union Commission, Regional Economic Communities (RECs), United Nations agencies, and other partners, supported by funding from the European Union (through ACT-62956 - Ending Violence Against Women and Girls in Africa and ACT-62355 - Fighting harmful practices, improving access to and deepening accountability for Sexual and Reproductive Health and Rights services in Africa)</narrative>
